-## P3.1 primeiro quadro de PillarArt (correção)
+~~~powershell
+npm run lint
+npm run typecheck
+npm test
+npm run build
+npm run test:e2e
+node scripts/qa-capture.mjs
+node scripts/lighthouse.mjs
